t and also a word document. \n \n &lt;font color=\"Red\"&gt;Last Updated: 9\/11\/08&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;advil, tylenol&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;alka-seltzer, imodium or pepto \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel size&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;aloe&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;beach ball&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;beach mat&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;beach towel&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;bookmark&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;bubble bath&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;bug spray&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;cameras (underwater, disposable, ect.)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;candle for the room&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;cd of music&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;double sided tape&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;dramamine&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;drink mix, powdered&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;fan&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;first-aid kit&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;flashlights \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel size&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;flip-flops&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;frisbees&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;gift certificate (spa, excursion, etc.)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;hand sanitizer&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;hangover kit&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;hats or visors&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;itinerary&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;key card holder&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;key chain&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;koozies&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;lib balm&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;lint roller \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel size&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;liquor bottle \u00e2\u20ac\u201c mini size&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;list of activities (on and off site)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;local snacks&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;location information&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;loofah&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;luggage tag&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;maps&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;matchbook&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;message in a bottle&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;mints\/gum&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;nail file&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;notepad&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;pashminas&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;photo albums&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;picture frame&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;playing cards&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;pool raft&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;postcards&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;puzzle book (sudoku, crossword, ect)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;safety pins&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;sarong&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;sewing kit \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;shot glass&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;shout stick or wipes&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;snacks (local, candy, salty, etc.)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;socks&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;spa salts&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;sunscreen&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;tank top\/shirt with wedding logo&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;tissue packet&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;translator \u00e2\u20ac\u201c english to xxxx common phrases&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;travel cup&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;welcome letter&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;wet wipes&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt;\n Let me know if you have others and I will add them into this list. This is what I have collected over the last couple months, Carla :)&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;5252&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;oot.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:28,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":433356,"PostDate":1219930121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi all,<br \/> Thought this list might help others since the info is scattered over a lot of posts. I have posted it as a list and also a word document. <br \/> <br \/> <font color=\"Red\">Last Updated: 9\/11\/08<\/font><br \/> <ul><li>advil, tylenol<\/li> <li>alka-seltzer, imodium or pepto \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel size<\/li> <li>aloe<\/li> <li>beach ball<\/li> <li>beach mat<\/li> <li>beach towel<\/li> <li>bookmark<\/li> <li>bubble bath<\/li> <li>bug spray<\/li> <li>cameras (underwater, disposable, ect.)<\/li> <li>candle for the room<\/li> <li>cd of music<\/li> <li>double sided tape<\/li> <li>dramamine<\/li> <li>drink mix, powdered<\/li> <li>fan<\/li> <li>first-aid kit<\/li> <li>flashlights \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel size<\/li> <li>flip-flops<\/li> <li>frisbees<\/li> <li>gift certificate (spa, excursion, etc.)<\/li> <li>hand sanitizer<\/li> <li>hangover kit<\/li> <li>hats or visors<\/li> <li>itinerary<\/li> <li>key card holder<\/li> <li>key chain<\/li> <li>koozies<\/li> <li>lib balm<\/li> <li>lint roller \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel size<\/li> <li>liquor bottle \u00e2\u20ac\u201c mini size<\/li> <li>list of activities (on and off site)<\/li> <li>local snacks<\/li> <li>location information<\/li> <li>loofah<\/li> <li>luggage tag<\/li> <li>maps<\/li> <li>matchbook<\/li> <li>message in a bottle<\/li> <li>mints\/gum<\/li> <li>nail file<\/li> <li>notepad<\/li> <li>pashminas<\/li> <li>photo albums<\/li> <li>picture frame<\/li> <li>playing cards<\/li> <li>pool raft<\/li> <li>postcards<\/li> <li>puzzle book (sudoku, crossword, ect)<\/li> <li>safety pins<\/li> <li>sarong<\/li> <li>sewing kit \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel<\/li> <li>shot glass<\/li> <li>shout stick or wipes<\/li> <li>snacks (local, candy, salty, etc.)<\/li> <li>socks<\/li> <li>spa salts<\/li> <li>sunscreen<\/li> <li>tank top\/shirt with wedding logo<\/li> <li>tissue packet<\/li> <li>translator \u00e2\u20ac\u201c english to xxxx common phrases<\/li> <li>travel cup<\/li> <li>welcome letter<\/li> <li>wet wipes<\/li> <\/ul><br \/> Let me know if you have others and I will add them into this list. This is what I have collected over the last couple months, Carla <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"5252\",\"name\":\"oot.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":28,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adias.angel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1207586809,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209035.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"adias.angel","Id":209035,"Name":"adias.angel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22731,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63e41831cc278ed14ced1edd7bf62d1d","RawContent":"oh wow - thanks! I have seen all the lists and try to write down all the bits from each bag that i think i need, but it sure is nice to see it all in one place! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":433490,"PostDate":1219934573,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                oh wow - thanks! I have seen all the lists and try to write down all the bits from each bag that i think i need, but it sure is nice to see it all in one place! <span rel